# Demo first (mandatory)

Always send Oscar a **demo version** of work (screenshots/artifacts in the PR, preview, or clear walkthrough).

**Do not** push/merge to `main` or make the site live unless he explicitly says:
- "go live", or
- "push", or
- "merge"

Otherwise keep changes on a feature branch + draft PR.

This rule also lives in `/AGENTS.md` for Claude and other agents.
